    "score": 87,
    "text": "This popup has been a constant gripe of mine for years.  I almost NEVER want to allow this permission and there is no system setting to disable it globally and prevent the popup from interrupting your typing, etc.  This tiny swift app I built will autoclose it in 1&#x2F;4th of a second and leave behind a little notification that it did so.  Would love to hear feedback!",
